==Battleground==
*1 [[Master Da Xun]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*4 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Hermit Peng]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**2 [[Master Da Xun]]s spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**1 [[Mighty Gui Zuli]] spawns.
**6 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**12 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Despite there being a Dober P.D, using normal meatshield tactics is fine, since Gui Zuli's high damage per hit means that Dober is going to be  missing his attacks often. Bring backliners to deal with Gui Zuli and you should be fine.

